 "transcript": [
  "[action] The second son works tirelessly in his business.",
  "[silence] the second son says nothing.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung is unable to sleep and goes to the eldest son's room.",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and what is it, my father?\"",
  "[action] Wang Lung asks his son why he is so busy.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Why are you so busy all day?\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"Well, and I am busy with my wife and my office and my household,\"",
  "the eldest son (to Wang Lung): \"and I am building a house for my parents' old age,\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"A house?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"Why not, my son?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"We are not yet at the time for a house,\"",
  "[says] Wang Lung expresses his doubts.",
  "Wang Lung (to the eldest son): \"There is no need for a house. I have the great house in the town for my old age, and the land I have, and that is enough.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung asks his son why he needs a house.",
  "[action] The eldest son enters the great house with his wife.",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Wang Lung observes his eldest son's family in the great house.",
